  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "程序化矿洞里采资源与失落科技，同步强化蜘蛛机甲和外骨骼",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Explore procedurally generated mines full of new discoveries and dangers. Extract valuable resources, harness lost technologies, and upgrade your robospider and exosuit to survive against hordes of raging monsters.",
